  "description": "探针：从另一个 App 调用 doc-intake 的对外服务，把原始返回或错误原样交出来，用来验证跨 App 调用这条路是否真的通。",
  "entry": "index.js",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "minAppVersion": "0.978.0",
  "capabilities": [
    "app/services.call",
    "app/tools.expose-to-model"
  ]
}
